diff --git a/docs/api/sections/users.md b/docs/api/sections/users.md
index 6af8e88..3ad64ac 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/users.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/users.md
@@ -148,3 +148,44 @@ Deactivates a user. You can only deactivate users you have permission to change.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the current browser for web push. You can only register a subscription for yourself. The same endpoint posted again updates the keys and owner, so a shared device follows whoever is signed in.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | Push service URL from the browser subscription |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | Client public key (`keys.p256dh`) |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | Client auth secret (`keys.auth`) |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/example",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNc...",
+    "auth_key": "a1b2..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+`201 Created` when the subscription is new, `200 OK` when an existing endpoint is updated:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/example"
+}
+```
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Removes a push subscription. You can only remove your own.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
